@startuml
title Dependency Management Flow With This Project
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

start
:Open the dependency management system;
:Enter one or more root work item IDs;

repeat
	:System expands related work items, child items, and pull requests;
	:System follows the next discovered relation automatically;
	:System repeats the traversal;
repeat while (New related items still exist?) is (yes)

:System gathers the linked commits automatically;
:System resolves version context from tags or branches;
:System groups the results into one dependency view;
:System aggregates the data for decision support;
:Developer reviews one consolidated result;
:Write the final conclusion faster with less manual search;
stop

note right
This project automates the recursive traversal and commit lookup steps.
It returns a consolidated view of work items, pull requests, commits, and version context.
The developer reads one result instead of repeating the Azure DevOps search manually.
end note

@enduml